    "title": "Martha's Vineyard is hosting a BBQ event of their own - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago Martha's Vineyard Mission on North 12th Street is hosting its own BBQ event this weekend. Martha Bell said that \"BBQ off the River\" on Friday and Saturday at the mission will feature mutton, chicken, ribs, and all the sides. They said that you can call ahead for pickup, or you can just drop by. Call 270-575-0021 for more information or to place an order. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
